		"description": "<p>Pulsers are high-intensity laser weapons, projecting an intense, brief laser pulse at the target. Security Pulsers are a variant designed for use by security personnel, and the weapon can adjust the pulse it generates to have a non-lethal effect. This “stun” pulse is painful to those shot, but the incapacitation lasts only a few minutes and leaves no lingering effects.</p><p>The profile for the Security Pulser can be found in the Security Weapons Table at the start of this section. It may replace its burned 2 Injury with stunned 2 on any attack, decided before any dice are rolled for the attack. A Security Pulser is a powered weapon, which recharges after a Break rest.</p>",
